  "body": "Part of #1261, epic #1184. Extend #1739’s event contract for audit-grade integrity, provenance and recovery; do not duplicate its stream or writers. Coordinate identity with #1253 and session attribution with #2072; use #1258’s storage, backup and restore decisions rather than inventing a competing platform.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n- [ ] Versioned records include stable ID, actor and attribution confidence, action, object, event/ingest timestamps, source link and source identity; pre-SSO/unknown actors are explicitly marked, never asserted as authenticated.\n- [ ] Audit records cannot be silently edited or deleted: authorized annotations/corrections are separate attributable records; integrity violations are detectable and tested.\n- [ ] A durable retry/reconciliation path prevents silent loss when a nonblocking #1739 append fails; failures and gaps are visible. Retention/archive policy and limits are explicit and do not silently discard required audit history.\n- [ ] Backup and restore of events and checkpoints is exercised against the storage and RPO/RTO decisions of #1258, with results and remaining loss visible.",
